# --- Lock files held open by the running server ---
# These are exclusively locked on Windows and cause: "session.lock: Permission denied".
# They are throwaway runtime state — never back them up.
session.lock

# --- Regenerated from the jar on every start / run — not worth backing up ---
/bundler/
/cache/
/logs/
/crash-reports/
/debug/
*.log
*.log.gz
hs_err_pid*.log

# --- Local JDK, if you ever extract one inside the repo ---
/jdk-*/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Kept intentionally (NOT ignored): world*/, plugins/, server.properties,
# eula.txt, ops/whitelist json, the server .jar, and the runner/panel code.
